          \MH_let:NwN \math@cr@@\MT_mult_firstandlast_mathcr:w
        \MH_fi:
        \ialign\bgroup
          \hfil\strut@$\m@th\displaystyle{}##
          \UseTaggingSocket{math/luamml/save/nNn}{ {} \displaystyle {mtd}}
          $
